h=h.replace('<div class="about-grid">','<div class="about-grid">'+"    <div class=\"about-card\" id=\"privacy\" style=\"grid-column:1 / -1\">\n      <p class=\"section-eyebrow\">Privacy notice</p>\n      <h3>Privacy &amp; your data</h3>\n      <p><small>Last updated: 3 November 2026</small></p>\n      <p>This notice covers this Safarnama website, not the separate services linked from it. You can browse guides, search and use the trip planner without signing in.</p>\n      <details open><summary><strong>Information collected and why</strong></summary>\n        <p>Sign-in uses Supabase authentication and, if you choose it, Google sign-in. Your email, account ID, basic account information and session tokens are used to authenticate you and remember your sign-in. The profile form stores the name and mobile number you enter in Supabase to remember your profile. These are not needed for public browsing.</p>\n        <p>Your Google password is entered with Google, not Safarnama. For existing email accounts, the password you enter is sent directly to Supabase for authentication, not saved in Safarnama browser storage. This site does not take bookings or payments, collect card details, or request precise device location.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details><summary><strong>Search and trip-planner inputs</strong></summary>\n        <p>Destination filtering and trip suggestions run in your browser. The current app does not upload your search text, starting city, travel months, party size, days or budget to its server. Opening an external route or booking search can include your chosen cities or destination in that service's link. Ordinary website requests still reach the hosting provider.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details><summary><strong>Cookies and browser storage</strong></summary>\n        <p>Safarnama uses localStorage for sign-in and refresh tokens, email, account ID, display name, cached names and temporary OAuth sign-in state. This keeps sign-in working across reloads. Log out to clear the stored sign-in session; cached names may remain. Clear this site's browser data to remove all locally stored Safarnama values. Neither action deletes the server account or profile.</p>\n        <p>No advertising tracker or audience-analytics SDK is configured in the current site code. Google, Supabase and Vercel may use necessary storage or cookies for their own authentication and security functions. Their policies apply to those functions.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details><summary><strong>Providers, images and external links</strong></summary>\n        <p>Vercel hosts the website and processes requests and security information, which can include IP address, browser details, requested paths and timestamps. Supabase provides authentication and profile storage. Google provides Google sign-in. Some guide images load from Wikimedia, whose servers receive ordinary image-request information. Other photos and the map graphic are served with the site. No external font service is configured.</p>\n        <p>Google Maps, transport, hotel and source links open independent services with their own privacy practices. Provider infrastructure can process information outside India; this is not an India-only storage service.</p>\n        <p><a href=\"https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vercel privacy</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://supabase.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Supabase privacy</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google privacy</a></p>\n      </details>\n      <details><summary><strong>Photos and AI</strong></summary>\n        <p>Photo-based AI destination detection has been removed. The current site has no photo-upload picker and the former photo endpoint is disabled. There is no current photo-analysis upload through this website.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details><summary><strong>Retention and security</strong></summary>\n        <p>Account and profile records remain in the project until removed by its operator. No automatic profile-deletion deadline is currently implemented. Local session data remains until logout, failed-expiry handling or browser-data clearing. Provider logs and backups have separate retention settings; no single deletion deadline is promised for all copies.</p>\n        <p>The site uses HTTPS and authenticated, user-specific profile access controls. These measures reduce risk but do not guarantee absolute security. Do not share passwords or enter sensitive identity, financial or health information in profile fields.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details><summary><strong>Your choices, account deletion and contact limitations</strong></summary>\n        <p>You can browse without an account, log out, clear browser site data and revoke Google sign-in access through your Google account. These actions do not delete the account or profile held by this project.</p>\n        <p>There is currently no self-service account-deletion button and no published privacy-request contact. A verified public contact and a defined access, correction and deletion request process are still being set up. Until these are available, do not create or submit a profile if you need a supported deletion-request route. This notice does not promise a deletion service that the site cannot yet provide.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details><summary><strong>Children and policy updates</strong></summary>\n        <p>The site has no age-verification or parental-consent flow. Do not submit a child's personal details or another person's information. Changes to data practices should be reflected in this notice with an updated date. This notice describes the current implementation; it is not a certification that every legal requirement has been met.</p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n");
